--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 8. GAMES & GAME ASSIGNMENTS
--   274 games over the season (Sat Sep 12 - Sat Nov 21, plus one weeknight round): every in-league team plays 12.
--   A and AA play a full round robin; AAA, Majors and Juniors repeat their round robins.
--   Juniors alternate between in-league weekends and out-of-league ones; Seniors play only out-of-league teams.
--   Out-of-league opponents are shown as a label (for example 'Menlo Park LL').
--   Games before Tue Oct 27, 2026 are 'completed' (with a few 'canceled' rainouts and all staffed);
--   later games are 'scheduled' with a mix of: staffed and confirmed, assigned but not yet confirmed,
--   half-staffed, and completely open (those open places show up as 'Games you can take').
--   The last Saturday's Juniors and Seniors games are still 'draft'.
--   Completed games also have attendance: most umpires arrived early, a few late, and a rare no-show.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
